rd, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":6,"title":"A yellow cat licking a little girl's face","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":7,"title":"A little girl hugging a smiling brown cat","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":8,"title":"A little girl hugging a brown cat who is trying to get away","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":9,"title":"A little girl hugging a long black cat and a short black cat","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":10,"title":"A little girl hugging an old and a young cat","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":11,"title":"A little girl hugging a big grey smiling cat in a park, and three little kittens","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":12,"title":"A man in uniform, and a girl sipping juice in front of a cage with two lions inside","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":13,"title":"A little cat hiding in a bag and peeping out","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":14,"title":"A little girl tired and yawning on her bed, with a cat getting inside the covers","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":15,"title":"A little smiling girl sleeping with two cats in her bed","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"},{"page":16,"title":"Little girl hugging a big grey smiling cat in a park","illustrator":"JP Brouard , Kalynne Vorster","holder":"JP Brouard, Kalynne Vorster","year":"2015"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಹೆಸರು ಜಿಲ್ಲಿ.","ಇವತ್ತು, ನಾನು ನಮ್ಮೂರಿನ","ಬೆಕ್ಕುಗಳನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ಅಪ್ಪಿ ಮುದ್ದಾಡಿದೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಪಕ್ಕದ ಮನೆಯವರ ಬೆನ್ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನು ಅಪ್ಪಿದೆ.","ಮಿಂಯಾವ್?","ಬೆನ್, “ಮಿಂಯಾವ್” ಎಂದಿತೇ?"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಸದಾ ಪಾರ್ಕು ಬೆಂಚಿನಡಿ ಮಲಗಿರುವ","ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನು ಅಪ್ಪಿಕೊಂಡೆ.","ಅದು ವಿಲವಿಲನೆ","ಒದ್ದಾಡಿತು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ನಾನು ಶ್ರೀಮತಿ ಲಿಲ್ಲಿ ಅವರ ಗುಂಡ ಬೆಕ್ಕು, ಶುಂಠಿಯನ್ನು ಅಪ್ಪಿದೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಅದು ನನ್ನ ಮುಖವನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನೆಕ್ಕಿತು.","“ಲಚ್ಕ, ಪಚ್ಕ.”","ಸೊರ್ ರ್!"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["‌","ಚಿಪ್ಸ್ ಅಂಗಡಿಯ ಆಜುಬಾಜಲ್ಲಿ ಮೀನು","ಆರಿಸಿ ತಿನ್ನುವ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನೂ ಮುದ್ದು ಮಾಡಿದೆ.","ಅದು, “ಅಂ ನಂ ನೋಮ್,” ಅಂತು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪಿದರೆ ಮುಖ ಸಿಂಡರಿಸುವ ಗೊಣಗು ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನೂ ಬಿಡಲಿಲ್ಲ!","ಅದಂತೂ ಗೋಳಾಡಿ ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ನಾನೊಂದು ಉದ್ದ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನು ಮುದ್ದು ಮಾಡಿದೆ.","ಹಾಗಂತ ಕುಳ್ಳ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನೂ ಬಿಡಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಮುದಿ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನು ನೇವರಿಸಿದೆ.","ಮರಿ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನೂ ಅಕ್ಕರೆ ಮಾಡಿದೆ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಬೆಕ್ಕಮ್ಮನನ್ನ ಅಪ್ಪಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವ ಮಜವೇನು ಗೊತ್ತಾ?","ಅದರ ಮರಿಗಳನ್ನೂ ಮುದ್ದಾಡಬಹುದು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":382},"text":["ಅಷ್ಟೇ ಏಕೆ, ಪ್ರಾಣಿ ಸಂಗ್ರಹಾಲಯದ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಬೆಕ್ಕುಗಳನ್ನೂ ಅಪ್ಪಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲು ಹೋಗಿದ್ದೆ.","ಆದರೆ, ಪ್ರಾಣಿ ಪಾಲಕರು, “ಅಯ್ಯೋ, ಬೇಡಮ್ಮ!” ಅಂದುಬಿಟ್ಟರು, ಇರಲಿ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಬಸ್ಸು ಹತ್ತಿದ ನಾನು, ಅಜ್ಜಿಯೊಬ್ಬಳ ಬ್ಯಾಗಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಅವಿತಿದ್ದ ಬೆಕ್ಕನ್ನೂ ಮುಟ್ಟಿ ನೇವರಿಸಿದೆ.","ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಕಿರುಚಾಡಿದರು! ಹೇ ಏಏಏ!"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಅಂತೂ ನಾನು ಮನೆಗೆ ಬಂದೆ.","ಆಆಆ!","ಜೂಲು ಬಾಲಗಳೆಲ್ಲಾ ಹತ್ತಿರ ಬಂದವು..."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["...ಮತ್ತು ನನ್ನನ್ನು ಅಪ್ಪಿದವು."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/589522-appugeya-dina/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":[]}],"wordCount":130}